{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026jcdSwxtDYQ1793257978.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>行政長官李家超下午公開宏福苑大火獨立委員會報告，及交代跟進工作，他率領相關官員鞠躬道歉。</p><p></p><p>行政長官李家超說：「對宏福苑火災發生，導致168人死亡，包括一位英勇救火殉職的消防員，1,984個家庭受影響，帶給災民悲痛、社會哀傷。我作為行政長官、政府之首，深感難過，我代表特區政府，向災民及廣大市民表示道歉。」</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T07:41:33.621099+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":152,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T07:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T07:58:12.638255+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T07:38:18.703329+00:00","content_hash":"6f40c9831061099646d614a36b75089a2ab330e3570c1c32893b89e443d4da70","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-29T07:41:33.621099+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}